title: 'v7.1 round 2: token estimates become learned (calibration)'
summary: 'Second v7.x fast-follow: AGENT_TOKEN_ESTIMATES is now self-improving. The CLI orchestrator captures each agent''s actual token usage per (archetype, taskType) to .paradigm/events/estimate-actuals.jsonl (best-effort); a new `paradigm calibrate` command aggregates robust p10/p90 bands (n>=8 floor) into .paradigm/learned/token-estimates.json; and the orchestration planner now prefers the learned table (loadLearnedTokenTable), falling back to the constant as a cold-start prior. The estimate shown is computed from what the crew actually spent. Build clean; mcp 373→378, cli 396→409.'
