learnings:
  - The calibration capture only needs ACTUALS (the learned band is p10/p90 of actual tokens); the estimate side stays MCP-side where the constant lives. Dropping estTokens from the captured record avoided exporting AGENT_TOKEN_ESTIMATES across the package boundary — simpler than the spec's original {estTokens, actualTokens} record.
  - Keyed by (archetype, taskType), not archetype alone — a builder on a bugfix and a builder on a feature spend differently, so the learned band is per-family. n>=8 floor prevents premature learning from thin samples; the constant remains the cold-start prior per cell until the crew has spent enough to learn it.
